WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.670
- What do we have here?
We have two new colors.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.950
We've got the new Mystic
Red, and Mystic White.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.950
The Samsung Galaxy Z Flip was...

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.420
Is my favorite phone of 2020.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.060
That's not to say that I
didn't love the Fold too,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.210
but there's just
something about this phone

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.390
that just felt incredible,

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:22.280
being able to flip that thing
open, it was just really cool.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.920
Look at that box, oh, so cool.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.020
I was actually just reminiscing

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.520
about when I got the original Z Flip.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.840
We went to the mall.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.500
We went all the way to Glendale,

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.780
which is not actually that far,

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.800
but when you live in the
west side of Los Angeles,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.830
you might as well just charter
a helicopter at that point.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.370
But I went and met John
at the Samsung store

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.020
because he had ordered two of these.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.700
So then I went and bought it off of him,

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.740
and went to the mall.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.800
That was a really fun video.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.537
That was right before lockdown.

00:00:46.537 --> 00:00:48.580
(gasps)

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.023
I'm so excited to see
this, I'm so excited.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.450
It's so freaking fresh.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.630
I don't even know what to say.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.450
This is the perfect color.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.420
It's a matte finish as well.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:08.943
Look at that. Holy
crap, this is beautiful.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.169
Oh my goodness. I'm
smudging it up already.

00:01:13.169 --> 00:01:16.330
(ethereal music)

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.163
Oh my god.

00:01:18.525 --> 00:01:19.713
Look at this!

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:26.190
Just beautiful, iridescent, mystic white!

00:01:31.954 --> 00:01:33.930
Let's see what else is in here.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.230
Charger, cable.

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:38.450
I mean, this is gonna kinda
be a really quick video

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.810
because you've already seen
reviews of both of these phones

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.380
on mine and everyone's channels.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.090
There's really not much
else to say about it.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:48.433
Do you wanna get a closer
look? Yeah, get in there.

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:51.683
(upbeat hip-hop music)

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.240
Even the little hinge has
sort of an iridescent color.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:58.240
I guess a little shade
of purple and a pink.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.910
Just enough to give it sort of that opal,

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.373
kind of iridescent look.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:07.773
So now let's check out the red Note 25G.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.280
Take a look at this.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.710
Wow.

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.530
I'm not a huge fan of the color red,

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.770
but when it is on these types of devices

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.850
with this kind of matte
frosted glass back,

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.460
it just really gives these
phones a whole other look.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.990
It gives it sort of a
dimensional type look.

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:30.161
Look at that, wow, get closer,
get closer, get closer.

00:02:30.161 --> 00:02:33.411
(upbeat hip-hop music)

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.853
Okay, let's look at
both of these together.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.590
Yeah, don't those look great?

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.000
So I know this is kind of a short video,

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.710
but I really wanted to
show these to you guys

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.040
because I really do
love when they bring out

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.800
different colors and different variations,

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.910
and I feel like the more
videos and more content

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.200
that you see these in
actual people's hands,

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.380
the better that you're able to judge

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.600
what the color would actually look like

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.550
when you get it in person.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.030
So this is it, this is
what they look like.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.340
I really, really...

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:09.000
I really love this red.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.950
I'm wondering from you guys, though,

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.780
what is your favorite phone
that was released in 2020?

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.050
Also, what is your favorite color phone

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.280
