00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.560
Even if that's not your
favorite phone from this year,

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.210
you can still say that you like the color.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.860
Also, what do you guys think about these?

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.120
Do you like the red, do
you like the mystic white?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.410
Because clearly we all know I'm obsessed.

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.920
I'll see you guys in my next video.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:29.803
Bye!

